{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/785750-what-do-you-want-to-make-most-when-the-exigents-book-hits-aside-from-exigents","id":785750,"title":"What do you want to make most when the Exigents book hits? (Aside from Exigents)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Exigents"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-13T21:44:26-08:00","id":785750,"title":"What do you want to make most when the Exigents book hits? (Aside from Exigents)","content":"The Exigents book is basically going to be the &quot;this is as much advice and help we can give you for making homebrew&quot; book, and it's no secret that just about every fan has their own ideas on how to tweak their Ex3 experience.<br /> <br /> Personally, at the moment I'm considering attempting a simpler alternative to the beautiful, but complex Martial Arts subsystem.<br /> <br /> Suppose you want to be a martial artist dude, with HWAH! and KATAW! and all that, but you don't really want to spend all that time, resources, and effort picking and choosing from the plethora of Martial Arts options? Suppose you can live with not being able to spend Solar Xp on your charms, and aren't really shedding tears over losing the option to be a dude that uses firewands <i>and</i> ladders (specifically) real good?<br /> <br /> Well, in the current system, your options are:<br /> <br /> A: Pick one of the four other combat abilities and say &quot;I'm a Kung-Fu dude, I just use Melee/Brawl/Archery/Thrown etc. etc. to express it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Or<br /> <br /> B: Fudge it, removing elements or the entire apparatus of the system (Needs individual Merit purchases, able to spend Solar Xp, learn individual styles, etc. etc.) and just do your own thing.<br /> <br /> I believe that there is another option: Homebrew a Native Martial Arts Charmset.<br /> <br /> Now, there will be drawbacks: It's specific instead of diverse and versatile, availability is reduced (No Solar Xp purchase, only accessible to specific splat), you lose out on the feel that the current system is going for (&quot;Martial Arts are esoteric and potent, like something akin to Sorcery in it's own way&quot;).<br /> <br /> But, if you have that person at the table who says &quot;I don't want to have to deal with all this. I just want to be a Kung-Fu guy and feel like it&quot; well, if it works out, this'll be for you.<br /> <br /> What are your ideas for customizing your game the Exigents book will help you achieve?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T22:33:05-08:00","id":785775,"title":"","content":"perhaps make charms to describe the abilities of whatever playable supernatural being you want to put into the setting. Raksha comes to mind.<br /> <br /> Sidereals and Infernals if homebrewers don't complete them first.<br /> <br /> potentially try to make my own Getimians.<br /> <br /> The Chosen of Oramus and Isidiros. <br /> <br /> things like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6018-raziere","name":"Raziere","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6018_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T22:43:57-08:00","id":785782,"title":"","content":"Gods. More appropriately, reverse engineered gods from extant Exigents. Then we discard the Exigents and balance is restored.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T22:56:01-08:00","id":785789,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure if you want to be mister Kung Fu, but without bothering with martial arts, you just take Brawl charms and/or Melee charms.<br /> <br /> Brawlers and melee folks can be students of styles, they're just not necessarily supernatural styles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T22:59:31-08:00","id":785790,"title":"","content":"Bruce Lee would totally be a Brawl-based character anyway, with a number of Martial Arts Charms, and maybe a couple of forms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T00:58:52-08:00","id":785815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kunoichi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/785750-what-do-you-want-to-make-most-when-the-exigents-book-hits-aside-from-exigents?p=785789#post785789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure if you want to be mister Kung Fu, but without bothering with martial arts, you just take Brawl charms and/or Melee charms.<br /> <br /> Brawlers and melee folks can be students of styles, they're just not necessarily supernatural styles.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did in fact mention this. The ideas I'm rolling around in my head are for someone who wants something that feels more distinctly like they are a kung-fu movie martial artist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T02:12:28-08:00","id":785835,"title":"","content":"Dragon-Kings, Mountain Folk and more than a few first circle demons...<br /> <br /> What? It has the whole 'homebrew balance matrix' and associated essays; I would be foolish not to take advantage. If official material comes out later, I can always claim my stop gap as a Wyld mutant version or a sorcerous experiment or any other plot point/hook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T19:16:08-08:00","id":786437,"title":"","content":"Probably Alchemicals. First anyway. After that, some experimental things. Like Exalts who's exaltations take the form of weapons. Or buildting the Trill race as Exalted (or something).<br /> <br /> ...Thinking on it, I might try building the Trill symbote as a Spirit/Working.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-15T06:19:21-08:00","id":786676,"title":"","content":"I'd try to think up some non-human race, and stat it. Maybe use it for Ancient Vampires of LoK (oh, the old loves...), and other Nosgoth residents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1673-runelord","name":"Runelord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1673_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-15T06:56:56-08:00","id":786696,"title":"","content":"I have 3 new splats and two kinds of Exigents which I want to make, and maybe even try to convert Nocturnals to the new Edition one way or another.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-15T08:05:06-08:00","id":786730,"title":"","content":"I'm kind of tempted to tinker some stuff from Shards (specially Burn Legend) into new splats or funky beings coming from Wyld and beyond, maybe some twisted adaptation/mockery of WoD or CoD stuff. mostly brainstorming so far, so no real desires beside whatever method there might be to the madness of making Exigents.<br /> Something to contrast against the funky 2e relics i cooked up to fill the same experimentalist niche the Exigents now seem geared to take.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-15T09:21:32-08:00","id":786754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/785750-what-do-you-want-to-make-most-when-the-exigents-book-hits-aside-from-exigents?p=786696#post786696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have 3 new splats and two kinds of Exigents which I want to make, and maybe even try to convert Nocturnals to the new Edition one way or another.</div> </div> </div> </div>I plan on doing something simular though I intend to mix in TAW Lunar charms into these Outsider Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","